/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// Every task starts from the caller's state: changes one task makes to globals are not seen by the next task or by the caller.
count | 0
seen | []
act bump(x)
    count |= count + x
    :put_last!(seen, x)
    return [count, seen.len]
xx
say(:swarm([1, 2, 3], bump, 1))
say(count)
say(seen)
